Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:43:51 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Log visibility diagnostics: opacity and contribution per
 Gaussian (logging only)

- sim_diag_accum gets two more columns: contribution sum of each valid view
  (sum over pixels of alpha * T, the denominator of the weighted mean) and the
  same value divided by the footprint area pi * radius^2.
- sem_log.jsonl: contrib_*, contrib_px_*, opacity_* summaries for the valid set
  and for the semantic selection.
- sem_snapshots/iter_*.npz: opacity, contrib_mean, contrib_per_px, scale_max, scale_min.
- Selection is unchanged (tests/test_decisive_cpu.py still matches commit 343c470).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PHmjveU9kNqt1TKBUX99W4
